{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"purescript","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"PureScript","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for PureScript (.purs).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"purescript","name":"PureScript","extensions":[".purs"],"grammar":"grammars/purescript.json","lineComment":"--","blockComment":["{-","-}"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"PureScript","path":"snippets/purescript.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/purescript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\{\\\\-\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\-\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\-\\\\-.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"->|<-|=>|::|<>|\\\\$|<\\\\$>|<\\\\*>|>>=\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:instance|foreign|newtype|derive|forall|hiding|import|infixl|infixr|module|class|false|infix|where|case|data|else|then|true|type|ado|let|do|if|in|of)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|unit)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Boolean|Number|String|Either|Effect|Array|Maybe|Tuple|Char|Unit|Int|Aff)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:show|pure|bind|log|map)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/purescript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"module ${1:Main} where\",\n      \"\",\n      \"import Prelude\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} :: ${2:Int} -> ${3:Int}\",\n      \"${1:name} ${4:x} = $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function with a type\"\n  },\n  \"Main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"main :: Effect Unit\",\n      \"main = do\",\n      \"  log \\\"${1:Hello}\\\"\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An Effect main\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# PureScript\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for PureScript.\n\n## Files\n\n`.purs`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `--`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `mod` | A module |\n| `fn` | A function with a type |\n| `main` | An Effect main |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}